        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5) = 120,]</span> what is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2z + 5?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "If [MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5) = 120,] what is the value of [MATH: 2z + 5?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5) = 120]</span> and are asked to find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2z + 5.]</span></p><p>We begin by combining like terms:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5)|= 120; (2 + 8)(2z + 5)|= 120; 10(2z + 5)|= 120]</span></p><p>Now we divide both sides by <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 10]</span> to isolate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2z + 5{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2z + 5|= (120)/(10); = 12]</span></p><p>Therefore, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2z + 5]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 12.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5) = 120] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 2z + 5.]\n\nWe begin by combining like terms:\n[MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5)|= 120; (2 + 8)(2z + 5)|= 120; 10(2z + 5)|= 120]\n\nNow we divide both sides by [MATH: 10] to isolate [MATH: 2z + 5{:}]\n[MATH: 2z + 5|= (120)/(10); = 12]\n\nTherefore, the value of [MATH: 2z + 5] is [MATH: 12.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nIf [MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5) = 120,] what is the value of [MATH: 2z + 5?]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe are given the equation [MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5) = 120] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 2z + 5.]\n\nWe begin by combining like terms:\n[MATH: 2(2z + 5) + 8(2z + 5)|= 120; (2 + 8)(2z + 5)|= 120; 10(2z + 5)|= 120]\n\nNow we divide both sides by [MATH: 10] to isolate [MATH: 2z + 5{:}]\n[MATH: 2z + 5|= (120)/(10); = 12]\n\nTherefore, the value of [MATH: 2z + 5] is [MATH: 12.]"
      },
